cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this construction, cite the archived release once it is available."
title: "A choice-free Paley-II construction of Hadamard matrices"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - family-names: Kline
    given-names: Jeffery
repository-code: "https://github.com/jeff-kline/p1mod4"
url: "https://github.com/jeff-kline/p1mod4"
license: GPL-3.0-only
abstract: >-
  An explicit, choice-free construction of a real Hadamard matrix of order
  2q(q+1) for every prime power q congruent to 1 modulo 4, together with a
  generalized characterization, exact verification code, and figures.
keywords:
  - Hadamard matrix
  - Paley construction
  - Scarpis construction
  - difference matrix
  - Butson matrix
